      "The resolver handles 02_PATTERNS_LOCAL.md ranked patterns 1-6 plus SYNTHESIS registration-indirection forms: from-import bases (with as-renames), assignment aliases, bare/imported register_class, list/tuple/append/factory registration.",
      "Cross-file registration: a registration site names an imported class; the site emits a node + plain class-name reference resolved cross-file by the pipeline. LIMITATION: host-callback method nodes for a class registered from a DIFFERENT file are not emitted — framework extract() runs per-file in isolated workers and postExtract() can only UPDATE existing nodes (db updateNode is UPDATE-by-id), so no channel exists to create the per-method nodes after the fact.",
      "Dynamic idnames, dynamic __annotations__ keys, computed import_module targets, and type()-generated classes emit nothing (never guessed, never diagnosed as nodes).",
